Suggests: akonadi-server, kdepim-runtime
Description: KDE integration for Magnolie Organizer
 This optional helper lets Magnolie Organizer use calendars and address books
 already configured in KDE. It communicates through a bounded local
 protocol and never receives account credentials.
 Three dormant native backends retain separate, generated dependency manifests.
 Only a complete, already installed matching KDE stack can be used. Installing
 this package does not install or configure a KDE personal-information suite.
